\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf2 <!$Scr_Ps::0><$Scr_Ps::1>
\f1\fs22 \'93Haloren Smythe,\'94 Hardman said.\
Halo straightened and looked at Gerry \'93Very\'94 Hard Man.\
\'93Commissioner, Director, Arch Spook,\'94 Halo returned. \'93Did I leave any out?\'94\
Halo noted the way Hardman pulled a sad kabuki face as he made a display of checking his device. \
\'93Ask me again tomorrow,\'94 Hardman said.\
Halo nodded. \'93Too early.\'94\
Gerry straightened. \'93Have you come for another play date with Sarah Jacobson?\'94\
\'93She improvised her own dance steps last time.\'94 Halo put the knife away, drew his Point of Order and twirled it in the light for Gerry.\
\'93She is very pregnant now,\'94 Gerry said, as if that might sway Halo. \'93I understand your friend\'97or should I say, your package, Anthony Chantara\'97is the father.\'94\
Halo smiled like a priest applying a benediction. \'93Chanta. My ol\'92 mate\'85 he\'92d still be waiting for permission. To think, the first time I saw her, she actually had me believing they were on a date.\'94\
\'93Excellent work on keeping Chantara. You\'92re an asset to the team. Pity about him becoming a figurehead for the Elvi.\'94\
Halo\'92s mood darkened but he stayed congenial. \'93You\'92ll leave Chanta alone.\'94\
Gerry smiled. \'93Your empathy tech won\'92t work on me, but I appreciate the attempt.\'94\
Halo nodded as if they were two builders assessing a fine piece of bricklaying.\
\'93Chantara is already down here somewhere, with a team of Elvi and Jones clones,\'94 Gerry said.\
\'93I saw that,\'94 Halo said.\
\'93I suspect he might get in the way of your next dance lesson.\'94\
\'93He\'92ll back his friends over a woman,\'94 Halo said with calm certainty. \'93But I won\'92t let him get to a point where he has to make that decision. I won\'92t do that to him.\'94\
\'93But you will take a shower in a pregnant woman\'92s blood.\'94\
Halo shrugged. \'93A man\'92s gotta have a hobby, Hard Man. Especially in this business; it messes with your head unless you can take time to switch off.\'94\
\'93You can have Jacobson,\'94 Gerry stated. \'93My objective is Eloise Shakti.\'94\
\'93Sure.\'94 Halo cocked an ear and listened. \'93Your kids are back.\'94\
\'93Hold,\'94 Gerry ordered as the first of the scout parties emerged from a corridor with their sights trained on Halo.\
Halo accepted the invitation to disappear.
